    rdfs:label "Grieneisen et al. (2007) Nature & Mähönen et al. (2014) Nature reverse-fountain root tip auxin reflux capacitor, Quiescent Center exponential accumulation, and PLETHORA meristem zonality — Model fidelity to source: 55/100" ;
